<title>JAPAN: Idemitsu to lower June oil product wholesale price.</title>
<headline>Idemitsu to lower June oil product wholesale price.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Major refiner Idemitsu Kosan Co Ltd said on Wednesday it would lower its oil product wholesale prices by one yen per litre effective June 1, due to lower crude oil prices.</p>
<p>Following the revision, the wholesale price for gasoline including tax will be 89.7 yen per litre, an Idemitsu official told a news conference.</p>
<p>Gas oil and kerosene will be set at 35.7 yen, he said.</p>
<p>The price cuts were made following a monthly review of wholesale prices which take into account global crude oil prices and currency market fluctuations.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Energy Desk +81-3-5473-3706</p>
</text>
